  "historyNote": "#4321, eff 10-6-87; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03 New. #7833, INTERIM, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 8-21-03 New. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400) New. #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24 (formerly Saf-C 1401.11) New. #14011, INTERIM, eff 6-27-24; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.14)",
